@@ -8302,3 +8302,4 @@ Did NOT modify research-roadmap.yaml or scripts/research_conductor.py. Did NOT p
 - 2026-06-02: CLEAN corrigendum of the re-freeze disambiguation — exp3704 reached the correct conservative conclusion (no candidate beats frozen 0.9131 under dual-condition rigor) but carries a BENIGN TAUTOLOGY flagged_adversarial (strongest_candidate_auroc == external_comparator_auroc BY CONSTRUCTION). Re-emit the disambiguation on a CLEAN, non-flagged artifact (preserve exp3704's numbers + add the correction note, exp1850 pattern), storing strongest_candidate as a STRING label so the de-tautology linter does not false-fire. Headline stays frozen; no record carries a flagged headline-adjacent artifact (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: refreeze_disambiguation_corrigendum_clean_no_candidate_beats_frozen_headline_stays_0_9131; results/experiment_3715_refreeze_disambiguation_clean_corrigendum.json
 - 2026-06-02: SHIP paper_v6_narrowing_lint.py — convert the G3 (prose narrowing-clean) gate from honor-discipline + an inline publication_gate.py phrasing scan to a STANDALONE pre-commit-style lint that scans docs/arxiv-paper/main.tex + docs/technical-report.md + any paper_v6_* artifact for the Paper-v6 Narrowing Discipline forbidden phrasings AND retracted numerical values (FoVer 0.9857, 11680x, etc.). CLAUDE.md says this lint SHOULD exist and does not. Mechanical G3 enforcement, additive (does not modify research_conductor.py) (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: paper_v6_narrowing_lint_shipped_g3_mechanically_enforced_current_paper_clean; results/experiment_3716_ship_paper_v6_narrowing_lint.json
 - 2026-06-02: Full G4 provenance audit — verify EVERY headline + north-star number (FoVer 0.9131, CI [0.9027,0.9235], FR-11 +0.0185 [0.0125,0.0245], the detector math operating point ~0.98/ECE~0.009) traces to a CLEAN, non-flagged primary results/experiment_*.json carrying random_seed + reproducibility_checksum — and that NO cited source carries flagged_adversarial (the exp3704 lesson). Hardens G4 from a capstone spot-check to an end-to-end audit (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: g4_fully_traced_every_headline_number_to_clean_primary_artifact; results/experiment_3717_g4_full_provenance_audit.json
+- 2026-06-02: RISK-COVERAGE ABSTENTION characterization of the proven 0.9131 discriminator — convert proven DISCRIMINATION (not SELECTION, which is closed) into a deployable SELECTIVE-PREDICTION operating envelope: the risk-coverage curve (AURC), risk@coverage operating points, and calibration of the shipped math-only detector as an abstention gate. Does the ENERGY signal beat the entropy/self-certainty baseline as a selective-prediction signal (arXiv:2603.21172 shows entropy fails)? This is the on-mission product framing (abstain when likely-wrong), distinct from the CLOSED best-of-N selection question (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: energy_is_a_better_selective_prediction_signal_than_entropy_deployable_abstention_gate; results/experiment_3718_risk_coverage_abstention_characterization.json
